047967             0158*   bar_val: equ 0 ; current value
047967             0159*   bar_x0: equ panel_x0
047967             0160*   bar_y0: equ panel_y0
047967             0161*   bar_x1: equ panel_x1
047967             0162*   bar_y1: equ panel_y1
