047B5D             0021*   tmr_laser: ds 6 ; rate timer for firing laser
       FF FF FF FF 
       FF FF 
047B63 0C 00 00    0022*   tmr_laser_reset: dl 120/10
047B66             0023*   laser_animation_timer_reset: equ 2 ; animate every two frames
047B66             0024*   
