048908             0084*   ; gets the next available tile id
048908             0085*   ; inputs; none
048908             0086*   ; returns: if new tile available, a = tile id, ix pointing to new tile vars, carry set
048908             0087*   ;      otherwise, a = 0, carry flag reset, ix invalid and must not be dereferenced
