048A0A             0241*   
048A0A             0242*   ; Remove a malformed stack entry without dereferencing the record pointer.
048A0A             0243*   ; A record referenced only by a corrupt entry may remain quarantined as alive;
048A0A             0244*   ; reclaiming an unknown physical record would be less safe than leaking a slot.
048A0A             0245*   tile_stack_quarantine_entry:
